    "summary": "RONL Business API v2026.11.3, in production: a new organisation, Caribisch Nederland at /bes, whose landing page gives residents their own DigiD login; Proces starten, where a caseworker starts any process its model lets them start, with the backend refusing everyone else; dynamic lists that save; and an unreachable BRP named in the API and in health, its certificate checked daily.",
